# hero-library Storage-Bucket, nicht ins Git (12000px-Originale, ~25MB).
/brand-assets/wingo/imagery/
# beschnittene Trial-Font (Demo-Satz, unbrauchbar fuer DE) — nur lokal als Referenz
/brand-assets/wingo/fonts/radikal-trial-unusable/

# Ship-Proof-Output (generierte 44-Asset-ZIP + Samples)
/scripts/ship-proof/
# Render-Preview-Output (manuelle previewSamples-Harness, PREVIEW=1)
/scripts/preview/
